_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/04d4da76a2f6a671355b2d55a6cbc305.poster.avif?t=1752137552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/04d4da76a2f6a671355b2d55a6cbc305.webm?t=1752137552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/04d4da76a2f6a671355b2d55a6cbc305.mp4?t=1752137552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore the Open Drifting World! Travel to Kyoto, Egypt, Persia, Rome, and more!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/83d7a612943f55812a69f3fc18142a2e.poster.avif?t=1752137552\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/83d7a612943f55812a69f3fc18142a2e.webm?t=1752137552\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1481340/extras/83d7a612943f55812a69f3fc18142a2e.mp4?t=1752137552\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Most players must have dreamed of traveling the world, but alas, time is not enough, and this goal can only slowly become a fantasy. However, in the game, players will have the opportunity to drive different modes of transportation and personally experience locations across the globe from ancient to modern times, including &quot;Asia, Europe, Antarctica, and even Mayan civilizations&quot;!!</p>",
